  "body": "School mornings just got effortless — step across the road to Westlake Boys High, with Westlake Girls High and Takapuna Normal Intermediate moments away. But what truly sets this home apart is its thoughtful design — where comfort, function, and space come together beautifully.\r\n\r\nThoughtfully Curated Layout\r\nThe ground floor welcomes you with a bright, open living area — the perfect heart of the home for everyday living and entertaining. Also downstairs: a single internal-access garage and a convenient guest toilet, so your visitors never need to go upstairs. Everything you use daily sits comfortably on this level.\r\n\r\nUpstairs — Rest & Retreat\r\nAll four bedrooms sit peacefully upstairs — creating a private sanctuary away from the main living area. Generous in size and bathed in natural light, each bedroom offers plenty of space for the whole family. The master bedroom provides that extra touch of luxury — your own quiet retreat at the end of the day.\r\n\r\nCraftsmanship & Quality\r\n• Freehold standalone home — no body corporate fees\r\n• Double-glazed + fully insulated — warm, quiet, efficient\r\n• Heat pumps throughout — year-round comfort\r\n• Premium Bosch appliances — quality you can rely on\r\n• Beautifully tiled bathrooms, premium fixtures — finishes that last\r\n\r\nPerfectly Placed\r\nWalk to Smales Farm, shops, Pak'n Save, and motorway access. Minutes to Takapuna and Wairau Park. Great schools nearby, spacious living inside — this is the complete Westlake package.\r\n\r\nCrafted with care, designed with vision, and positioned perfectly. Enquire today — this one is special.",
